---
import GovLayout from '../layouts/GovLayout.astro';
---
<GovLayout title="회계 실무관리 | 대한불교밀교종">
  <div class="ops-app" data-app hidden>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a href="/accounting-operations/" class="brand"><img src="/logo.png" alt="대한불교밀교종 로고" /><span><img src="/brand-wordmark.png" alt="대한불교밀교종" /><b>회계 실무관리</b></span></a>
      <div class="top-actions"><span data-user-label></span><a href="/accounting/" class="btn btn-outline">기본 회계</a><a href="/accounting-special/" class="btn btn-outline">특화회계</a><a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">전자문서</a><button class="btn btn-outline" data-logout>로그아웃</button></div>
    </header>
    <div class="shell">
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <label class="year-box">회계연도<select data-year></select></label>
        <nav>
          <button class="nav active" data-tab="overview">실무관리 현황</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="reconciliation">통장·카드 대사</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="budget">예산 변경·통제</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="contract">거래처·계약·지출</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="donation">전자기부금영수증</button>
        </nav>
        <p class="side-note">가져온 거래의 미대사 건과 월 대사 미확정 계좌가 있으면 해당 월을 마감할 수 없습니다.</p>
      </aside>
      <main class="main">
        <div class="notice" data-notice hidden></div>

        <section class="panel active" data-panel="overview">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>FINANCE OPERATIONS</p><h1>회계 실무관리 현황</h1><span>거래 대사, 예산 변경통제, 계약 지급, 전자기부금영수증 처리를 한곳에서 관리합니다.</span></div></div>
          <div class="summary-grid">
            <button data-jump="reconciliation"><span>미대사 거래</span><strong data-summary-unmatched>0건</strong><small>확인필요 포함</small></button>
            <button data-jump="budget"><span>예산 변경 승인대기</span><strong data-summary-budget>0건</strong><small>승인 후에만 현예산 반영</small></button>
            <button data-jump="contract"><span>45일 내 종료 계약</span><strong data-summary-contract>0건</strong><small>종료·갱신 알림</small></button>
            <button data-jump="donation"><span>기부금 처리오류</span><strong data-summary-donation>0건</strong><small>홈택스 결과 재확인</small></button>
          </div>
          <div class="card guide-grid">
            <article><b>1. 거래 가져오기</b><span>은행·카드 CSV/XLSX 열을 매핑하고 중복을 제거합니다.</span></article>
            <article><b>2. 자동대사</b><span>금액·일자·거래처·승인번호를 비교해 자동확정 또는 후보를 제시합니다.</span></article>
            <article><b>3. 예산·계약 통제</b><span>집행액과 계약 약정액을 차감한 실제 가용예산을 관리합니다.</span></article>
            <article><b>4. 결과 동기화</b><span>홈택스 처리결과를 다시 가져와 발급·오류·취소 상태를 반영합니다.</span></article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="reconciliation">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>RECONCILIATION</p><h1>통장·법인카드 가져오기 및 자동대사</h1><span>금융기관 API 없이 CSV·XLSX 파일을 가져와 기존 기부금·결의서·카드내역과 연결합니다.</span></div><button class="btn btn-primary manager-only" data-auto-match-all>미대사 자동대사</button></div>
          <div class="two-cols manager-only">
            <form class="card" data-bank-form><h2>대사 대상 계좌 등록</h2><div class="form-grid three"><label>계좌코드<input name="accountCode" required placeholder="예: NH-001" /></label><label>은행<input name="bankName" required /></label><label>계좌명<input name="accountAlias" required placeholder="운영비 통장" /></label><label>계좌번호<input name="accountNumber" placeholder="저장 시 마스킹" /></label><label>입출금 계정<select name="settlementAccountCode" data-asset-account></select></label><label>회계조직<select name="entityId" data-entity></select></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">계좌 저장</button></div></form>
            <form class="card" data-rule-form><h2>자동분류 규칙</h2><div class="form-grid three"><label>규칙명<input name="name" required /></label><label>자료유형<select name="sourceType"><option value="all">전체</option><option value="bank">통장</option><option value="card">카드</option></select></label><label>입출금<select name="direction"><option value="all">전체</option><option value="in">입금</option><option value="out">출금</option></select></label><label>포함 단어<input name="keyword" required placeholder="예: 한국전력" /></label><label>분류 계정<select name="accountCode" data-all-account></select></label><label>우선순위<input name="priority" type="number" value="100" min="1" max="999" /></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">규칙 저장</button></div></form>
          </div>
          <form class="card manager-only" data-import-form>
            <div class="card-head"><div><h2>거래내역 파일 가져오기</h2><p>첫 행은 열 제목이어야 하며 한 번에 최대 1,000건까지 처리합니다.</p></div><label class="file-btn btn btn-outline">CSV·XLSX 선택<input name="file" type="file" accept=".csv,.xlsx" hidden /></label></div>
            <div class="form-grid five"><label>자료유형<select name="sourceType"><option value="bank">통장</option><option value="card">법인카드</option></select></label><label>대상 계좌·카드<select name="sourceAccountId" required></select></label><label>조회 시작일<input name="periodStart" type="date" /></label><label>조회 종료일<input name="periodEnd" type="date" /></label><label>통장 월말잔액<input name="statementBalance" inputmode="numeric" /></label></div>
            <div class="mapping-box" data-mapping hidden><h3>파일 열 연결</h3><div class="mapping-grid" data-mapping-fields></div><p data-file-summary></p></div>
            <div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-run-import disabled>가져오기 실행</button></div>
          </form>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-head"><h2>미대사 작업함</h2><div class="filters"><select data-tx-batch><option value="">전체 가져오기</option></select><select data-tx-status><option value="">전체상태</option><option value="unmatched">미대사</option><option value="suggested">확인필요</option><option value="matched">대사완료</option><option value="ignored">제외</option></select><input data-tx-query placeholder="거래처·적요·승인번호" /><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-transactions>조회</button></div></div>
            <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>거래일</th><th>자료</th><th>입출금</th><th>거래처·적요</th><th>금액</th><th>자동분류</th><th>대사자료</th><th>상태</th><th>처리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-tx-rows></tbody></table></div>
          </div>
          <div class="two-cols">
            <form class="card manager-only" data-recon-form><h2>월 대사 확정</h2><div class="form-grid two"><label>자료유형<select name="sourceType"><option value="bank">통장</option><option value="card">법인카드</option></select></label><label>계좌·카드<select name="sourceAccountId"></select></label><label>대사 월<input name="month" type="month" /></label><label>통장 월말잔액<input name="statementBalance" inputmode="numeric" /></label></div><label>비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">잔액검증·확정</button></div></form>
            <div class="card"><h2>월별 대사표</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>월</th><th>자료</th><th>통장잔액</th><th>장부잔액</th><th>차이</th><th>미대사</th><th>상태</th></tr></thead><tbody data-recon-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="budget">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>BUDGET CONTROL</p><h1>예산 변경·통제 워크플로</h1><span>본예산을 직접 덮어쓰지 않고 변경요청과 승인 이력을 남기며 계약 약정액까지 반영합니다.</span></div></div>
          <form class="card" data-budget-change-form><h2>예산 변경요청</h2><div class="form-grid four"><label>변경유형<select name="changeType"><option value="supplementary">추가경정</option><option value="transfer">전용·이체</option><option value="reduction">감액</option><option value="over_budget_exception">초과집행 예외</option></select></label><label>대상 예산<select name="targetBudgetId" data-budget-select required></select></label><label data-source-budget-field hidden>재원 예산<select name="sourceBudgetId" data-budget-source></select></label><label>금액<input name="amount" inputmode="numeric" required /></label><label data-valid-until-field hidden>예외승인 유효일<input name="validUntil" type="date" /></label><label class="span-3">변경 사유<textarea name="reason" required></textarea></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">승인 요청</button></div></form>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>가용예산 현황</h2><span>현예산 − 집행액 − 계약 약정액</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>부서·사업</th><th>계정과목</th><th>현예산</th><th>집행액</th><th>약정액</th><th>가용예산</th><th>상태</th></tr></thead><tbody data-budget-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          <div class="card"><h2>변경요청·승인이력</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>요청번호</th><th>유형</th><th>대상</th><th>금액</th><th>사유</th><th>요청자</th><th>상태</th><th>처리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-budget-change-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="contract">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>VENDOR & CONTRACT</p><h1>거래처·계약·지출 전체 연결</h1><span>거래처 계좌변경을 별도 승인하고 계약·지급일정·지출결의·전표를 연결합니다.</span></div></div>
          <div class="two-cols manager-only">
            <form class="card" data-vendor-form><h2>거래처 등록</h2><div class="form-grid three"><label>거래처명<input name="name" required /></label><label>사업자번호·고유번호<input name="businessNo" maxlength="12" /></label><label>대표자<input name="representative" /></label><label>담당자<input name="contactName" /></label><label>연락처<input name="phone" /></label><label>이메일<input name="email" type="email" /></label><label>은행<input name="bankName" /></label><label>계좌번호<input name="bankAccountNumber" placeholder="마스킹·해시 저장" /></label><label>예금주<input name="bankAccountHolder" /></label><label class="span-3 check"><input name="conflictChecked" type="checkbox" /> 이해충돌·특수관계인 확인 완료</label><label class="span-3">확인 메모<textarea name="conflictNote"></textarea></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">거래처 저장</button></div></form>
            <form class="card" data-bank-change-form><h2>거래처 계좌변경 요청</h2><div class="form-grid two"><label>거래처<select name="vendorId" data-vendor-select required></select></label><label>은행<input name="bankName" required /></label><label>새 계좌번호<input name="bankAccountNumber" required /></label><label>예금주<input name="bankAccountHolder" required /></label><label class="span-2">변경 사유<textarea name="reason" required></textarea></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">변경 승인 요청</button></div></form>
          </div>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>거래처 목록</h2><div class="filters"><input data-vendor-query placeholder="거래처명·사업자번호" /><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-vendors>조회</button></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>코드</th><th>거래처</th><th>사업자번호</th><th>대표·담당</th><th>등록계좌</th><th>활성계약</th><th>계좌변경</th></tr></thead><tbody data-vendor-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          <div class="card manager-only"><h2>계좌변경 승인대기</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>거래처</th><th>기존계좌</th><th>변경계좌</th><th>사유</th><th>요청자</th><th>상태</th><th>처리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-bank-change-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          <form class="card manager-only" data-contract-form><h2>계약 등록</h2><div class="form-grid five"><label>거래처<select name="vendorId" data-vendor-select required></select></label><label>계약명<input name="title" required /></label><label>계약금액<input name="amount" inputmode="numeric" required /></label><label>계약일<input name="contractDate" type="date" required /></label><label>계약방법<select name="procurementMethod"><option value="competitive">경쟁계약</option><option value="limited">제한·지명</option><option value="sole_source">수의계약</option></select></label><label>시작일<input name="startDate" type="date" required /></label><label>종료일<input name="endDate" type="date" required /></label><label>부서<input name="department" /></label><label>사업<input name="project" /></label><label>지출계정<select name="accountCode" data-expense-account></select></label><label>회계조직<select name="entityId" data-entity></select></label><label>재원<select name="fundId" data-fund></select></label><label class="check"><input name="multiQuoteChecked" type="checkbox" /> 복수견적 확인</label><label class="check"><input name="conflictChecked" type="checkbox" required /> 이해충돌 확인</label><label class="check"><input name="inspectionRequired" type="checkbox" checked /> 검수 필요</label><label class="span-2">수의계약 사유<textarea name="soleSourceReason"></textarea></label><label class="span-3">비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">계약 저장</button></div></form>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>계약·지급 현황</h2><div class="filters"><select data-contract-status><option value="">전체상태</option><option value="active">진행</option><option value="completed">완료</option></select><input data-contract-query placeholder="계약·거래처 검색" /><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-contracts>조회</button></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>계약번호</th><th>거래처·계약명</th><th>기간</th><th>계약금액</th><th>지급액</th><th>잔액</th><th>계약방법</th><th>상태</th><th>지급관리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-contract-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="donation">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>E-DONATION RECEIPT</p><h1>전자기부금영수증 일괄처리</h1><span>홈택스 작업용 Excel을 생성하고 처리결과를 다시 가져와 발급상태를 동기화합니다.</span></div></div>
          <div class="warning"><b>개인정보 처리 안내</b><span>식별번호 원문은 시스템과 서버에 저장하지 않습니다. 생성된 작업파일의 빈 식별번호 열은 안전한 업무환경에서만 작성하고, 홈택스가 제공하는 최신 Excel 서식의 열 구성과 다시 대조해 업로드하세요.</span></div>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>일괄발급 대상</h2><button class="btn btn-primary manager-only" data-create-donation-export>선택건 Excel 생성</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th><input type="checkbox" data-check-all-donations /></th><th>기부번호</th><th>기부일</th><th>기부자</th><th>연락처</th><th>금액</th><th>기부금코드</th><th>현재상태</th></tr></thead><tbody data-donation-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          <div class="two-cols">
            <div class="card"><h2>일괄처리 이력</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>처리번호</th><th>건수</th><th>성공</th><th>오류</th><th>상태</th><th>파일</th></tr></thead><tbody data-export-batch-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
            <form class="card manager-only" data-result-form><h2>홈택스 처리결과 가져오기</h2><label>일괄처리 건<select name="batchId" data-export-batch-select required></select></label><label>결과 CSV·XLSX<input name="file" type="file" accept=".csv,.xlsx" required /></label><p>열 제목 예: 내부관리번호(기부번호), 처리결과, 홈택스 발급번호, 오류내용</p><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">결과 반영</button></div></form>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>

  <dialog data-match-dialog><form method="dialog" class="dialog-card"><div class="card-head"><h2>대사 후보 선택</h2><button class="icon-btn" value="cancel">×</button></div><div data-match-candidates></div><div class="form-actions"><button value="cancel" class="btn btn-outline">취소</button><button value="confirm" class="btn btn-primary" data-confirm-candidate>선택 연결</button></div></form></dialog>
  <dialog data-contract-dialog><div class="dialog-card wide"><div class="card-head"><div><h2 data-contract-dialog-title>계약 지급관리</h2><p data-contract-dialog-subtitle></p></div><button class="icon-btn" data-close-contract-dialog>×</button></div><form data-payment-form class="manager-only"><input name="contractId" type="hidden" /><div class="form-grid four"><label>지급명<input name="paymentName" required /></label><label>지급예정일<input name="dueDate" type="date" /></label><label>금액<input name="amount" inputmode="numeric" required /></label><label>검수일<input name="inspectionDate" type="date" /></label><label class="span-3">비고<input name="memo" /></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">지급일정 추가</button></div></form><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>회차</th><th>지급명</th><th>예정일</th><th>금액</th><th>결의·전표</th><th>상태</th><th>연결</th></tr></thead><tbody data-payment-rows></tbody></table></div></div></dialog>

  <script>
    const $=(selector,root=document)=>root.querySelector(selector);
    const $$=(selector,root=document)=>[...root.querySelectorAll(selector)];
    const esc=(value)=>String(value??'').replace(/[&<>'"]/g,(char)=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;',"'":'&#39;','"':'&quot;'}[char]));
    const won=(value)=>`${Number(value||0).toLocaleString('ko-KR')}원`;
    const money=(value)=>Math.round(Number(String(value??'').replace(/[^0-9.-]/g,''))||0);
